paddock · 4 running · 3 wait for you                                              Runs   Board   Approvals ◆3   Mail ✉2
╭─ Command palette · type to search · ↵ runs · Esc closes ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ :                                                                                                                    │
│ › H         the home screen: new agent, apps, requests, runs, world, settings                                        │
│   ↵         open the selected item                                                                                   │
│   q Esc     go back (quit on the first screen)                                                                       │
│   n         new run: harness, project, prompt file                                                                   │
│   s         stop the selected run (asks first)                                                                       │
│   v         split view of the marked runs, or view the selected run                                                  │
│   Space     mark a run for the split view                                                                            │
│   o         open the live view of the run in a new terminal window                                                   │
│   w         write a message to the agent of the run                                                                  │
│   r         show the runs                                                                                            │
│   b         show the board: the ranch, or the list                                                                   │
│   a         show the approvals that wait                                                                             │
│   m         show the mail of the runs                                                                                │
│   Tab       next tab or pane (Shift+Tab back)                                                                        │
│   /         filter the list                                                                                          │
│   : Ctrl+P  command palette: every action                                                                            │
│   ?         this help                                                                                                │
│   M         mouse on or off (off: the terminal selects text)                                                         │
│   L         runs as rooms (a card and a character per run) or as a list                                              │
│   W         show the ranch: the board as a world                                                                     │
│   P         ranch: Plumbing on or off (glass walls, tools, cables)                                                   │
│   I         ranch: the Inspector (the paddock word and command)                                                      │
│   z         ranch: pause or resume the selected room                                                                 │
│   f         Files of this run: what the agent changed in its copy                                                    │
│             Apply all changes of this run to your folder (asks first)                                                │
│             Backups of the project of this run                                                                       │
│             Pointer state: the store of the copies and backups                                                       │
│   R         read paddock again now                                                                                   │
│   Ctrl+C Q  quit                                                                                                     │
